{"path": "/student", "title": "Studentrabatt på mat i Oslo? Slik spiser du billig ute | BIMM", "styles": ["/reference/1f65bfd9ce6a89dd.css", "/reference/38b1dea288c4762f.css"], "bodyClass": "nacellefont_2a5c70b4-module__-Y0KqG__className flex flex-col flex-1 w-full h-full bimm", "html": "<div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div><div data-overlay-container=\"true\" class=\"flex flex-col flex-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1\"><nav class=\"flex w-full h-auto items-center justify-center data-[menu-open=true]:border-none sticky top-0 inset-x-0 bg-ds-bg-warm/90 backdrop-blur-md z-50\" style=\"--navbar-height:4rem;transform:none\"><header class=\"z-40 flex gap-4 w-full flex-row relative flex-nowrap items-center justify-between h-[var(--navbar-height)] px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-[40px] xl:px-[100px] 2xl:px-[200px] py-[15px] max-w-none\"><ul class=\"flex gap-4 h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0\" data-justify=\"start\"><a class=\"flex basis-0 flex-row flex-grow flex-nowrap justify-start bg-transparent items-center no-underline text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border shrink-0 !basis-auto !flex-grow-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"BIMM\" width=\"989\" height=\"293\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-[100px] md:w-[130px] h-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/reference/2845d56155219054.png\"/></a></ul><ul class=\"h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0 hidden lg:flex gap-5 xl:gap-[49px]\" data-justify=\"center\"><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"#what-is-bimm\">What is BIMM</a></li><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a></li><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"/deals\">Our Deals</a></li><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></li></ul><ul class=\"h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0 hidden lg:flex gap-3\" data-justify=\"end\"><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap flex items-center justify-center h-[51px] px-[26px] rounded-[14px] bg-white text-ds-text-black text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.2px] shadow-[0px_4px_7.8px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/#download\">Download the App</a></li></ul><ul class=\"flex gap-4 h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0 lg:hidden !flex-grow-0\" data-justify=\"end\"><button class=\"group flex items-center justify-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 w-[42px] h-[42px] rounded-[16.8px] bg-ds-bg-off shadow-[0px_2.52px_12.6px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"sr-only\">open navigation menu</span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 7h14M4 11h14M4 15h14\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></ul></header></nav><main class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center min-w-36\"><section class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-16\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mb-4\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/\">BIMM</a><span class=\"mx-1.5\">/</span><span class=\"text-black/70\">Studenter</span></nav><h1 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[44px] font-semibold tracking-[-1px] leading-tight\">Spis <span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald\">billig ute</span> som student i Oslo</h1><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Å spise ute i Oslo er dyrt på et studentbudsjett, og de fleste spisestedene har ingen egen studentrabatt. BIMM er en tilbudsapp med 100 aktive deals hos 48 spisesteder i Oslo — 2-for-1-retter, kronerabatter og gratisvarer — for 49 kr per måned, eller 295 kr i året (24,58 kr/mnd), og stempelkortene er gratis helt uten abonnement.</p><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Slik funker det: finn en deal i appen, book dag og tidspunkt, møt opp og sjekk inn — ingen kuponger eller koder.</p><p class=\"text-black/40 text-[13px] mt-4\">Oppdatert oktober 2026</p><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Dette får du som student</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Alle deals for 49 kr i måneden</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Ett abonnement gir tilgang til alle deals i appen — 2-for-1-retter, kronerabatter, gratisvarer og gavekort. Ingen skjulte gebyrer, og du kan si opp når som helst.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Gratis stempelkort</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Stempelkortene hos kaffebarer, bakerier og restauranter er gratis for alle — du trenger ikke abonnement. Samle stempler og få en belønning etter et visst antall kjøp.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Student-e-posten kan låse opp Premium</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Noen universiteter og arbeidsgivere har godkjente e-postdomener som låser opp BIMM Premium uten kostnad. Verifiser universitets- eller jobb-e-posten din i appen for å sjekke — tilgangen bekreftes på nytt med jevne mellomrom.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Inviter en venn</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Inviter en venn til BIMM, så får dere én måned med Premium gratis hver.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mb-1.5\">Regnestykket</p><p class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-medium max-w-[760px]\">75 av de 100 aktive dealene i Oslo sparer deg for mer enn en måned med BIMM Premium (49 kr) på ett eneste besøk. Med årsabonnement (295 kr — 24,58 kr/mnd) betaler du omtrent halvparten per måned.</p></div><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Billig mat til studentlivet</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">Kaffe til lesesalen, pizza med kollokviegruppa eller en burger etter forelesning — her er kategorier i BIMM som passer godt til studentlivet, med spisesteder og deals hentet live.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Kaffebarer</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">36 steder i denne kategorien</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/sweetmint-grunerlokka\">Sweetmint Grünerløkka</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 95 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/twintea\">Twintea</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 83 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/the-fragrance-of-the-heart-majorstuen\">The Fragrance of the Heart - Majorstuen</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 110 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Bakerier</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">13 steder i denne kategorien</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/bonbon-oslo\">BonBon Oslo</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 100 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/boulangerie-m-skoyen\">Boulangerie M Skøyen</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 40 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/encore-kafe-and-konditori-oslo\">Encore Kafe &amp; Konditori Oslo</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 26 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Pizza</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">9 steder i denne kategorien</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Mamma Pizza Osteria Italiana</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-vika-osteria-di-mare\">Mamma Pizza Vika Osteria di Mare</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/haus-di-gusto\">Haus di Gusto</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 262 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Burgere</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">8 steder i denne kategorien</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/johnny-rockets-storo\">Johnny Rockets Storo</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 300 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/sabrura-sticks-and-sushi-valkyrien\">Sabrura Sticks &amp; Sushi Valkyrien</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 180 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/cafe-laundromat\">Café Laundromat</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Spar 138 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Italiensk</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">19 steder i denne kategorien</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Mamma Pizza Osteria Italiana</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-vika-osteria-di-mare\">Mamma Pizza Vika Osteria di Mare</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/haus-di-gusto\">Haus di Gusto</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — spar ca. 262 NOK</span></li></ul></div></div><a class=\"inline-block mt-6 rounded-full bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\" href=\"/deals/oslo\">Se alle deals i Oslo</a></section><section aria-label=\"Ofte stilte spørsmål fra studenter\" class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] mb-5\">Ofte stilte spørsmål fra studenter</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-[820px]\"><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Finnes det studentrabatt på restauranter i Oslo?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Noen få spisesteder har egne studenttilbud, men de fleste restauranter i Oslo har ingen fast studentrabatt. For de fleste studenter er tilbudsapper den enkleste måten å få medlemspriser på. BIMM koster 49 kr per måned, eller 295 kr per år (24,58 kr/mnd), og gir tilgang til alle deals i appen — som 2-for-1-retter, kronerabatter og gratisvarer. Noen universiteter og arbeidsgivere har dessuten godkjente e-postdomener som låser opp BIMM Premium uten kostnad; verifiser universitets- eller jobb-e-posten din i appen for å sjekke.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Er BIMM gratis for studenter?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Appen er gratis å laste ned, og stempelkortene kan alle bruke gratis uten abonnement. Selve dealene krever BIMM Premium — 49 kr per måned, eller 295 kr per år (24,58 kr/mnd) — som du kan si opp når som helst. Noen universiteter og arbeidsgivere har godkjente e-postdomener som låser opp Premium uten kostnad — verifiser universitets-e-posten din i appen for å sjekke. Tilgangen bekreftes på nytt med jevne mellomrom.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Hvordan spiser jeg billig ute i Oslo som student?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Planlegg rundt tilbudene i stedet for å velge spisested først. Del en 2-for-1-rett med en venn, legg besøket til dealens tidsvindu (mange gjelder bestemte dager eller tider), og bruk gratis stempelkort på kaffen og bakverket du uansett kjøper. Inviterer du en venn til BIMM, får dere i tillegg én måned med Premium gratis hver.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Hva slags tilbud finnes i BIMM?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Dealene er 2-for-1-retter, rabatter med et fast kronebeløp, gratisvarer og gavekort — i tillegg til stempelkort som gir deg en belønning etter et visst antall kjøp. Noen deals gjelder bestemte dager eller tidsrom. Slik bruker du en deal: finn den i appen, book dag og tidspunkt, møt opp og sjekk inn — ingen kuponger eller koder. Tilbudene finnes først og fremst i Oslo og noen få andre byer.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Kan jeg si opp når som helst?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Ja. BIMM Premium koster 49 kr per måned, eller 295 kr per år (24,58 kr/mnd) — uten bindingstid og uten skjulte gebyrer — du kan si opp når som helst. Stempelkortene kan du uansett fortsette å bruke gratis uten abonnement.</p></details></div></section></div></section><div class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm py-10 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1520px] px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[14px] lg:hidden\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden h-[620px]\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/reference/d972bdbf2cb31d3d.webp\"/><div class=\"relative z-[5] flex flex-col items-center gap-[20px] w-full pt-[23px]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 w-[140px] h-[48px]\"><img alt=\"BIMM\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"989\" height=\"293\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/reference/85d5cf1438fe1490.webp\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center text-white gap-[12px]\"><h2 id=\"download\" class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-1.68px] w-[330px]\">Klar for å spise smartere?</h2><p class=\"text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.33] tracking-[-0.32px] w-[206px]\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Last ned BIMM</span> <!-- -->og begynn å spare i dag!</p></div></div><img alt=\"BIMM app\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1481\" height=\"3205\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"absolute z-[2] top-[41%] left-[8%] w-[84%]\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/reference/c1c5a0f7b2ea84b6.webp\"/></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 w-full\"><a role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" class=\"z-0 group relative inline-flex items-center justify